[[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the nut.</p><p>2. Remove the wiper arm (2b) using the tool (2a).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Code</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td></td><td><p>Removing wiper arm</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the pipe from the headlamp wash/wipe reservoir.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/179007791.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the wiper arm.</p><p>Connect the pipe from the headlamp wash/wipe reservoir.</p><p>Tighten the nut fixing the wiper arm.</p>"]]